她边弹边唱的全景动态。画面完美捕捉了面部表情、手部动作与身体律动的高度协调。\n\n关键特征保持：【核心约束】人物必须全程保持“边弹边唱”的连贯状态。面部唇形必须与歌声节奏精准同步，严禁中途闭口；手指与吉他琴弦之间必须保持精准的物理接触与按压姿态，严禁手指穿模、悬浮或扭曲。吉他的红棕色琴身必须随着复合运镜的视角变化，产生符合真实物理逻辑的光影流转和环境光反射。女子的面部结构稳定，无AI形变。\n\n细节描述：房间内光线柔和且富有层次，精准勾勒出女子的轮廓与衣物的蕾丝纹理。在自弹自唱时，她的身体随着音乐节奏产生自然的微幅律动，长发随之轻轻飘散。她眼神专注且深情，带有与观众交流的情感张力。整体画面色彩复古且高级，多种运镜之间的衔接如丝般顺滑，动作流畅自然。\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "link": 454, "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 226, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [285], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [2594.6640625, 691.37158203125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 412, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 251, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 122, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 33}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [414], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [140, 26], "pos": [2114.677734375, 703.9112548828125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 413, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {}, "id": 213, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "ou