字手势，松弛自信。\n分镜 5：俏皮互动与华丽收尾（16-19秒）\n歌手左手叉腰右手持麦，身体微倾，姿态放松坚定。镜头捕捉侧脸轮廓，光线在脸颊形成明暗对比。她正对镜头站直，淡青裙身在蓝色背景下清新亮眼，随即转身，多层裙摆随之旋转，展现动态层次美，裙摆划过弧线，完美收尾。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "link": 450, "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 233, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [457], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [370, 390], "pos": [1263.4271240234375, 2445.055908203125], "widgets_values": ["角色全程唱歌跳舞，中景，4k高清\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "link": 455, "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 241, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [454], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["主体定义：image1中的角色说话，正面对镜头进行极具感染力的口播介绍。她双手自然托举商品，但并非僵硬静止，而是随着说话节奏进行【微小的重心调整】和【手腕的自然翻转展示】。商品在手中保持结构稳定，但会有随呼吸产生的轻微起伏。\n\n内容摘要：一支电影级质感的商业口播，拒绝“站桩式”播报。镜头采用【极缓慢的呼吸感推镜头】（Dolly In），模拟摄影师手持跟拍的微妙呼吸起伏，而非机械平移。人物与商品互动自然，仿佛正在与观众面对面交谈，而非对着机器念稿。\n\n关键特征保持：【核心约束】口型与音频全程像素级同步，换气停顿处保持自然微张嘴过渡，严禁中途闭口。【动态约束】人物必须有【真实的生理微动】：说话时伴随自然的眨眼（每3-5秒一次）、轻微的点头强调、肩部随呼吸的起伏。手部展示商品时，手指关节需有自然的弯曲和抓握力，严禁手指僵直或穿模。面部结构、五官、服装全程100%一致，无AI形变。\n\n细节描述：女性置身于高级商业空间，眼神【聚焦镜头中心】，带有自信的交流感，而非空洞直视。她一手稳托商品底部，另一手【自然辅助展示】（如轻点商品边缘、手掌微摊），动作幅度小而精致，符合人体工学。三点式布光下，皮肤有真实的毛孔质感，商品反光随手部微动而产生【自然的光影流转】。背景保持光学稳定，但允许极轻微的景深变化以增强空间感。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [58.85622787475586, 2441.578125], "id": 245, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 17}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [205.8459303244992, -313.2609523550994], "scale": 0.8954302432552388}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 8, "title": "宽", "bounding": [66.51475524902344, 661.0821533203125, 281.5013122558594, 175.2723846435547]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 9, "title": "高", "bounding": [67.82695007324219, 844.302001953125, 281.5013122558594, 175.2723846435547]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 240, "flags": {}, "id": 10, "title": "MiniMax H3 数字人口播唱歌", "bounding": [-114.4142074584961, 0.1217387318611145, 3144.187744140625, 334.4095458984375]}, {"color": "#a1309b", "font_size": 40, "flags": {}, "id": 11, "title": "戒不戒ai，JBJ", "bounding": [-1038.4417724609375, 653.7379760742188, 572.0150756835938, 1294.4124755859375]}, {"color": "#8AA", "font_size": 42, "flags": {}, "id": 12, "title": "扣扣群：1090604544", "bounding": [-1019.931640625, 1392.2357177734375, 528.511962890625, 80]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 13, "title": "音频开始", "bounding": [73.66889953613281, 1055.7874755859375, 281.5013122558594, 175.2723846435547]}, {"color": 